                                                "sense_id": "6bd68927-9cb6-3c72-9b01-c357afce036f",
                                                "text": "“In the early years, they were the most primitive structures ever to fly in space, cheap and overbuilt and overcrewed, hoisted on cavorite wings.”"
                                            }
